      "intent": "Apply the permutation that maps each town i to n+1-i to the entire input (including n, x, y, and all edges). Run the program on this transformed input and assert the output equals the original output. A violation is a difference, indicating the answer depends on the specific labels."
    },
    {
      "name": "test_edge_order",
      "intent": "Reverse the order of the edge lines (the last n-1 lines) of the input. Run the program on this reordered input and assert the output equals the original output. A violation indicates the program relies on the order of edge listing."
    },
    {
      "name": "test_brute_force",
      "intent": "Enumerate all ordered pairs (u,v) with u ≠ v. For each pair, compute the unique path in the tree (using BFS/DFS) and determine whether it contains x before y. Count the pairs that do NOT exhibit this forbidden pattern. Assert that the output equals this count. A violation is any discrepancy."
    },
    {
      "name": "test_complement",
