    {
      "name": "test_upper_bound_alternating",
      "intent": "Compute the number of changes needed to transform the string into an alternating pattern starting with 'R', and similarly for starting with 'L'. Let U be the minimum of these two numbers. Assert the output is at most U. A violation is an output larger than U, because one can always achieve a logical configuration with U changes to an alternating pattern."
