      "name": "test_swap_inside_outside_same_relation",
      "intent": "For each query, if possible, swap an element inside [l,r] (not at x) that is less than p[x] with an element outside [l,r] that is also less than p[x]. The answer should not change. A change indicates a wrong answer."
    },
    {
      "name": "test_duplicate_query",
