      "name": "test_lower_illogical",
      "intent": "Compute the number I of players currently illogical (attacked by exactly one but not attacking that attacker). Assert that the answer is at least ceil(I/3), because each flip can fix at most three illogical players. A violation indicates an answer too small to fix all illogical players."
