      "name": "test_upper_constructive",
      "intent": "Break the circle into runs of consecutive same characters. For each run of length L, flip every third player starting from the second player. Count the total flips C and verify the resulting configuration is logical. Assert the answer is at most C. A violation indicates an answer larger than a known achievable number of flips."
