      "name": "test_metamorphic_prepend",
      "intent": "Create a modified input by prepending a new song with c=1, t=1 and increasing each query by 1. Run the program on both original and modified inputs. The outputs for the modified input must be exactly one greater than the original outputs. A mismatch reveals an error in handling offsets."
    },
    {
      "name": "test_metamorphic_append",
