    },
    {
      "name": "test_bruteforce_small",
      "intent": "If N ≤ 12, enumerate all subsets of K positions for blue balls, compute the number of blue runs for each arrangement, tally counts for i=1..K, and compare to the output modulo MOD. Any discrepancy indicates a wrong answer. For larger N, skip the test."
    },
    {
      "name": "test_non_negative",
      "intent": "Parse each output line as an integer and verify that it is non‑negative and less than MOD. Outputs outside [0, MOD‑1] are invalid."
    },
    {
      "name": "test_zero_for_large_i",
      "intent": "For each i from 1 to K, if i > N - K + 1, assert that the corresponding output value is 0. Since having more blue runs than reds+1 is impossible, non‑zero here is an error."
