    {
      "name": "test_shift_invariance",
      "intent": "If the input is valid and max(t) < 10^9, create a new input by adding 1 to each time in t (keeping n and c the same). Run the program on this new input and assert its output equals k, because shifting all times by a constant does not affect differences."
    },
    {
      "name": "test_append_within_c",
      "intent": "If the input is valid and the last time t_n plus c ≤ 10^9, create a new input with n+1 words, appending a word at time t_n + c (keeping c the same). Run the program on this new input and assert its output equals k + 1, because appending a word exactly c seconds after the last word should increase the count by one."
