    },
    {
      "name": "test_metamorphic_even",
      "intent": "If s is even, call run on str(s//2) to obtain the output m2 for the half‑input. Assert that m ≤ m2 + 1. This relation holds because the sequence for s contains the sequence for s/2 starting at the second term, so any repetition in the full sequence occurs no later than one step after the first repetition in the tail."
    },
    {
      "name": "test_integer_values",
