{
  "rationale": "We combine bounds, invariants, metamorphic relations, and certificates to catch wrong answers. Bounds (0≤ans≤n, ans=0 when x>n²) catch gross errors. Parity tests symmetry. Monotonicity in n catches errors related to table size. Witness tests catch false positives/negatives. Full verification catches any error. If dropping one, drop test_zero_witness as subsumed by full verification.",
  "plan": [
