    },
    {
      "name": "test_vx_zero",
      "intent": "For inputs where vx == 0 and vy != 0, if x is not 0 and not n, the output must be -1. Otherwise, if x is 0 or n, the output must be (x,0) when vy < 0, and (x,m) when vy > 0."
